9	// Complex range `r1 || r2 || ...` is a subset of `R1 || R2 || ...` iff:
10	// - Every simple range `r1, r2, ...` is a null set, OR
11	// - Every simple range `r1, r2, ...` which is not a null set is a subset of
12	//   some `R1, R2, ...`
